Package: nubifer-resources
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-boto3
Recommends: nubifer-creds, nubifer-workspace
Maintainer: NubiferOS Project <info@nubiferos.org>
Homepage: https://nubiferos.org
Description: NubiferOS cloud resource viewer
 Read-only cached inventory of AWS resources (EC2, S3, Lambda, RDS,
 VPC) with search and offline browsing. Syncs via the default AWS
 credential chain (credential_process compatible); stores resource
 metadata only, never credentials or secrets.
